+	 * :is() and :where() with nothing in them match nothing -- and
+	 * GitHub's stylesheet ships a literal ":is(){...}". Appending no
+	 * details at all would leave the bare universal selector behind,
+	 * so the rule would match every element instead of none: that one
+	 * rule sets width, height and position on everything and takes the
+	 * whole page with it. Append "not *" instead, which matches
